# Architecture boundaries

## Domain (`packages/domain`)

- No `node:fs`, `node:net`, or `bun:fs` imports — enforced by `domain-no-io.test.ts`.
- Session mutations go through `ServerSession`; persistence lives in `server-host`.

## Admin UI (`packages/admin-ui`)

- Must **not** import `@bizshuffle-bun/server-host` or server internals.
- Talk to the server only via HTTP/WebSocket (`fetch`, admin WS) — enforced by `admin-isolation.test.ts`.

## Protocol vs host

- Shared types and codecs → `@bizshuffle-bun/protocol`.
- HTTP routes, WS hub, disk I/O → `@bizshuffle-bun/server-host`.
- Player-side downloads, BizHawk, Lua IPC → `@bizshuffle-bun/client-host`.

## Admin static

- `bun run build:admin` must produce `packages/server-host/priv/static/index.html`.
- Desktop embeds that path; do not hardcode alternate static locations without updating `static-path.ts`.
